<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Refund Policy - Krishna National Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 15px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 50px 50px 60px;
        }

        .content p {
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .section ul {
            margin-left: 25px;
            color: #546e7a;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .section li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .highlight-box {
            background: rgba(244, 67, 54, 0.08);
            border-left: 4px solid #f44336;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .highlight-box p {
            color: #c62828;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .info-box {
            background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.08);
            border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .info-box p {
            color: #1565c0;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.08);
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .back-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.15);
            transform: translateX(-5px);
        }

        .footer-note {
            text-align: center;
            color: #78909c;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content, .header {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }

            .content, .header {
                padding: 30px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
            <p>Last Updated: February 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>
                We understand that circumstances may change. This Refund Policy outlines the conditions under 
                which refunds may be issued for Krishna National Contest 2026 registration fees.
            </p>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                <p><strong>Important:</strong> All registration fees are generally non-refundable once payment is completed and registration is confirmed.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Refund Eligibility</h3>
                <p>Refunds may be considered under the following exceptional circumstances:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Technical Errors:</strong> If payment was processed multiple times due to technical issues</li>
                    <li><strong>Contest Cancellation:</strong> If the contest is cancelled by the organizers</li>
                    <li><strong>Medical Emergency:</strong> With valid medical documentation submitted within 7 days</li>
                    <li><strong>Payment Errors:</strong> If you were charged incorrectly or for wrong category</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Non-Refundable Situations</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Change of mind after successful registration</li>
                    <li>Inability to participate due to personal reasons (except medical emergencies)</li>
                    <li>Missed submission deadlines</li>
                    <li>Disqualification due to rule violations</li>
                    <li>Dissatisfaction with contest results or judging</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Refund Process</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Refund requests must be submitted via email to support@krishnacontest.org</li>
                    <li>Include your registration details, payment receipt, and reason for refund</li>
                    <li>Provide any supporting documentation (medical certificates, etc.)</li>
                    <li>Refund requests are processed within 15-20 business days</li>
                    <li>Approved refunds will be credited to the original payment method</li>
                    <li>A processing fee may be deducted from the refund amount</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Processing Time:</strong> Approved refunds typically take 7-10 business days to reflect in your account after approval.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Contest Cancellation by Organizers</h3>
                <p>
                    In the unlikely event that the contest is cancelled by ISKCON or the organizers, 
                    all registered participants will receive a full refund of their registration fees. 
                    Participants will be notified via email and refunds will be processed automatically.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Contact for Refund Queries</h3>
                <p>
                    For any refund-related questions or to initiate a refund request:<br>
                    <strong>Email:</strong> support@krishnacontest.org<br>
                    <strong>Phone:</strong> +91-XXXXXXXXXX<br>
                    <strong>Subject Line:</strong> "Refund Request - [Your Registration ID]"
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-note">
                <p>© 2026 Krishna National Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
